{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32145","headline":"罩鱼歌 · 温庭筠","name":"罩鱼歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝罩罩城南，暮罩罩城西。\n两浆鸣幽幽，莲子相高低。\n持罩入深水，金鳞大如手。\n鱼尾迸圆波，千珠落湘藕。\n风颸颸，雨离离，菱尖茭刺鸂鶒飞。\n水连网眼白如影，淅沥篷声寒点微。\n楚岸有花花盖屋，金塘柳色前溪曲。\n悠溶杳若去无穷，五色澄潭鸭头绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}